00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:51.620
Chapter 19 Sky

00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:54.920
Hey, water!

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:56.220
Bring some water!

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:06.870
Can't be having you
passing out on us so easily.

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:10.350
We gotta punish you good
and long before you die.

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:28.200
Susumu...

00:02:32.910 --> 00:02:34.550
Where's the Commander and Mr. Hijikata?!

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:36.700
They seem to have been at the
Aizu Clan House since morning.

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:37.870
Forget them!

00:02:37.870 --> 00:02:39.760
The Second and Tenth Units
will be going out alone!

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:42.620
But there are still some people
who haven't returned from patrol!

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:44.410
We'll just go with whoever's available!

00:02:44.410 --> 00:02:47.180
What's the location?!
On the other side of Shijo Ohhashi Bridge!

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:48.830
Is everyone ready?!

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:50.650
Sir, we will be shortly!

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:23.960
Uh...

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:25.790
Um...

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:29.800
You come to rile me up again?

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:35.980
Well?

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:48.120
You think...

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:51.500
You think I get mad because I want to?!

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:56.460
If only you weren't around,
I wouldn't have to feel this way.

00:03:58.580 --> 00:04:00.040
Go ahead.

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:01.710
If you want to hit me, hit me.

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:07.420
About all I'm good for is
to make you mad, anyway.

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:11.080
But instead...

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:13.980
Please, go to where Ayu is!

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:16.880
Someone reported it just now.

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:23.320
That a hairdresser woman
is being beat up by ronin.

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:27.320
I'm sure it's Ayu.

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:30.080
So, please!

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:35.160
Why won't you?!

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:38.460
She's your big sister, isn't she?!

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:42.670
I've never thought of
her that way, not once.

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:44.950
Why don't you go to her?

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:47.370
You're the one she cried
and told her dying wish to.

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:49.310
I'll bet she'd be happy to see you, too.

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:15.950
You know what Ayu said?!
What she said to me?!

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:18.500
She asked me to take
care of her kid brother!

00:05:18.890 --> 00:05:20.910
She asked me to take care of you!

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:22.840
That's what she said!

00:05:30.540 --> 00:05:34.120
You've got no right to
call her your big sister.

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:48.320
<i>What's with that look on your face?</i>

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:56.580
<i>Where the heck do you think you'll
find a spy that laughs and cries?</i>

00:05:57.410 --> 00:06:00.410
<i>Are you going on about being
scared and embarrassed again?</i>

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.130
<i>Hurry up and get rid of those feelings.</i>

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:08.220
<i>There's going to be no one around you.</i>

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:10.640
<i>You have to be able to do it all yourself.</i>

00:06:15.620 --> 00:06:17.270
<i>You're not a samurai.</i>

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:19.140
<i>You're a spy.</i>

00:06:22.950 --> 00:06:27.120
<i>You don't need to think
of me as your big sister.</i>

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:30.700
<i>I don't think of you as
my kid brother, either.</i>

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:39.160
<i>Say, when you've grown a bit more,</i>

00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:41.950
<i>you're going to do jobs disguised as me.</i>

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:44.840
<i>And then...</i>

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:53.320
<i>And then, see...</i>

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:05.420
<i>Even if I should happen to botch a job...</i>

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:10.650
<i>Even if I die, you can still survive.</i>

00:07:38.370 --> 00:07:39.230
S...

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:42.280
Sister...

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:10.380
It should've been you
who ended up like that.

00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:16.650
You, the incompetent one,
should've been the one who died.

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:27.310
Now, you're all alone.

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:34.480
In the end, people are alone, both when
they're born and when they die.

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:42.120
What did you come here
for at this late hour?

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:44.830
Did you think to come to her rescue?

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:47.850
Rescue the woman who took the
place of your incompetent self?

00:08:49.580 --> 00:08:52.050
Come up rather short, haven't you?

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:55.450
If your heart aches, why don't
you quit being a spy?

00:08:57.660 --> 00:09:01.680
Of course, you're not qualified to
continue doing this now anyway.

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:06.730
I doubt we'll have occasion
to see each other again.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:25.750
How many of them are there total?!

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:27.620
We were able to apprehend four!

00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:29.540
Two have fled!

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:32.630
The Second Unit is
pursuing the two who fled!

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:36.160
All right, go ahead and take
away the ones we nabbed!

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:38.540
If they try to run, you can
cut them down on the spot!

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:39.720
Yes, sir!

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:41.310
Sano!

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:43.520
What about Ayu?

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:45.370
Don't know.

00:09:45.370 --> 00:09:49.400
Tetsunosuke's looking around
the area right now, though.

00:09:52.410 --> 00:09:53.360
Damn it!

00:09:56.870 --> 00:10:00.280
Why? Why did things end
up in this situation?!

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:05.560
<i>Ayu...</i>

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:45.620
Hey, Tetsu!

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:47.620
Hey, did you find her?!

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:48.120
Shinsengumi

00:12:27.040 --> 00:12:32.540
If only we'd gotten there just a
little sooner, this wouldn't have...

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:34.500
It's all in the past now.

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:36.960
Sano, what kind of thing to say is that?!

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:40.110
You two...

00:12:40.660 --> 00:12:42.540
we are in Miss Ayumu's presence.

00:12:42.540 --> 00:12:43.610
Stop it.

00:13:03.820 --> 00:13:06.200
Ah. Took you a while, Toshi.

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:34.660
Men, listen closely.

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:38.410
The funeral will be done
quickly and secretly.

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:43.710
Saito and Takeda, take care of
torturing the apprehended ronin.

00:13:44.120 --> 00:13:49.540
Henceforth, the area from Shijo to
Sanjo will be patrolled thoroughly.

00:13:49.540 --> 00:13:51.140
That is all.

00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:52.640
Hijikata...

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:56.380
Is that all you want to say?

00:13:58.040 --> 00:14:00.480
We may be mobilizing in the near future.

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:04.270
Those on death shift had
better be prepared!

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:16.370
Mr. Hijikata.

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:17.900
Mr. Hijikata!

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:22.330
Soji, we're bringing in
that Masuya bastard!

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:26.370
You get ready to mobilize too.
I've made the arrangements.

00:14:26.370 --> 00:14:27.630
Mr. Hijikata...

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:29.750
He's finally revealed his true colors!

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:32.660
First, we'll use the Masuya
lead to crush the Choshu!

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:35.520
And Yoshida too, whom
Masuya's likely sheltering!

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:37.020
Mr. Hijikata!

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:42.160
It's not...

00:14:43.700 --> 00:14:45.180
It's not your fault.

00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:22.000
Stay away!

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:56.120
What? The dog come to laugh at the loser?

00:15:56.120 --> 00:15:59.040
Or did you come to observe
me being all messed up?

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:00.060
You know, I...

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:04.580
The other day, I had all
sorts of things on my mind,

00:16:04.580 --> 00:16:07.200
so I couldn't bring myself to eat dinner.

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:11.580
I think it was broiled fish,
some stewed stuff, and...

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:17.000
Oh, I drank all the miso soup,

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:19.830
but I could only finish
about half the meal...

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:24.330
So, I didn't eat it all.

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:29.100
It was the last meal Ayu made,
and I didn't finish it.

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:35.130
And what's more, I didn't
eat it while it was still hot.

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:39.290
I'm sorry. I'm sorry, Ayu.

00:16:39.290 --> 00:16:40.620
Don't apologize.

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:43.040
I'm so sorry!

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:45.950
Don't apologize! It's depressing!

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:48.060
I'm... sorry...

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:53.440
I'm sorr...

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:15.450
I should...

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:18.120
apologize too.

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:25.410
She took my place so I could become
a full-fledged spy, and she died.

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:28.330
What was the point in rushing
to where she was after that?

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:31.000
But that was...

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:33.910
And if I get killed on top of that, too,

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:35.870
it'd all just be a lost cause...

00:17:38.790 --> 00:17:40.240
I can't stand it...

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:47.160
So what if I'm told I'm
a failure of a spy now?

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:51.500
I failed her as a kid brother long ago...

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:53.950
Talk about coming up short.

00:17:53.950 --> 00:17:55.700
It's so stupid.

00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:57.330
And it pisses me off...

00:17:57.330 --> 00:17:58.860
It pisses me off so much...

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:03.370
And I just hurt all over, I can't stand it!

00:18:09.250 --> 00:18:10.910
You know, that's like...

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:13.920
That's not being pissed.

00:18:15.370 --> 00:18:17.120
It's called being sad.

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:25.790
I never...

00:18:27.200 --> 00:18:29.540
I never...

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:34.050
got a chance to call her "Sister"...

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:58.740
<i>At the very least, until the
crying at my back stops,</i>

00:18:58.910 --> 00:19:01.120
<i>I'll bear this bit of pain...</i>

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:17.050
That fool! Did he fall...?

00:19:18.750 --> 00:19:19.130
Ouch!

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:27.720
What the hell?! That seriously hurts!

00:19:28.660 --> 00:19:32.290
Wait, that noise sounded
really weird! You okay?!

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:33.310
Ow...

00:19:33.620 --> 00:19:36.120
Can you stand?! Can you move?!

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:38.030
Shut your mouth for a bit...

00:19:38.450 --> 00:19:41.330
Man, was I in a panic.

00:19:41.330 --> 00:19:44.380
I thought maybe you got up
half asleep and fell.

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:54.000
Oh, man, I've been up here for a while.

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:55.420
I better get down soon.

00:19:55.950 --> 00:19:58.950
Tatsu might be looking around for me.

00:19:58.950 --> 00:20:01.930
And I technically have page duties, too.

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:03.970
Oh, yeah, that reminds me.

00:20:04.200 --> 00:20:05.600
Well, uh...

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:08.470
You know that thing where I said you didn't
have any right and stuff this morning?

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:10.060
I take that back, okay?

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:15.280
Whoa, looking at it from up here,
we're higher up than I thought.

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:20.740
The one to take back
everything that's been said...

00:20:26.040 --> 00:20:28.620
should be me.

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:29.830
Oh, yeah!

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:31.910
Susumu!

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:35.080
Starting tomorrow, I'll
be your great teacher,

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:39.000
and teach you <i>all </i>sorts of things
that you don't know about!

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:41.580
You better be ready for it!

00:20:41.580 --> 00:20:43.330
Well, so that's the deal!

00:20:43.330 --> 00:20:45.870
You should eat, take a bath
and go to sleep soon, too!

00:20:45.870 --> 00:20:46.640
Hold it!

00:20:47.200 --> 00:20:48.430
Huh?

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:50.430
What did you just say?

00:20:50.620 --> 00:20:54.870
I <i>said</i>, I'll teach you fun stuff
that you don't know about,

00:20:54.870 --> 00:21:00.110
like funny stories and how
to serve mopped-up tea.

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:02.400
Because I have a feeling you'll get all
down in the dumps if I leave you alone.

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:03.640
Not that.

00:21:04.290 --> 00:21:06.200
What did you just call me?

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:10.760
Hey!

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:14.660
Look, I...

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:18.920
I have a policy of calling my
friends by name, all right?!

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:26.370
Tetsu! So, <i>this </i>is where you were!

00:21:26.370 --> 00:21:28.290
Oh, Tatsu!

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:30.910
We've all been looking for you!
Making us worry like that!

00:21:30.910 --> 00:21:32.890
Come on, hurry up and get down here!

00:21:32.890 --> 00:21:36.000
Right now! Immediately! Promptly!

00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:38.520
Don't shake it, Tatsu! Hey!

00:21:40.830 --> 00:21:42.910
Tatsu, you moron!

00:22:03.620 --> 00:22:07.910
<i>Gripping the microphone tight,
the hit parade's on parade</i>

00:22:07.910 --> 00:22:11.470
<i>Hey, Jimmy, how you feeling?</i>

00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:15.790
<i>Quite the gentleman when he's off stage</i>

00:22:15.790 --> 00:22:19.480
<i>Hey, Jimmy, a generous spirit too!</i>

00:22:19.480 --> 00:22:23.440
<i>Being such an honest guy,
even his life's plain</i>

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:27.290
<i>Keep building it up patiently</i>

00:22:27.290 --> 00:22:31.290
<i>May your dreams come true honestly</i>

00:22:31.290 --> 00:22:35.040
<i>Let's go for it again today, Jimmy</i>

00:22:37.210 --> 00:22:40.660
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:22:40.660 --> 00:22:44.590
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:48.500
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:22:48.500 --> 00:22:52.640
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:23:08.280 --> 00:23:12.030
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:23:12.030 --> 00:23:16.040
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:23:16.040 --> 00:23:20.080
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:24.330
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:29.220
Next Peacemaker Kurogane

00:23:26.750 --> 00:23:28.700
<i>We're bringing Masuya in!</i>

00:23:28.700 --> 00:23:30.620
<i>All men, get your equipment
ready and await mobilization!</i>

00:23:30.620 --> 00:23:32.220
<i>I will take the death shift.</i>

00:23:32.750 --> 00:23:35.220
<i>I am not acting on a personal grudge.</i>

00:23:35.220 --> 00:23:39.320
<i>Next time, Peacemaker Kurogane,
Chapter 20: "Blade."</i>

00:23:38.480 --> 00:23:40.810
Chapter 20 Blade

00:23:39.450 --> 00:23:40.810
<i>Say your prayers.</i>
